    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νο-ήμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtful, intelligent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ οὔ τι νοήμονες οὐδὲ δίκαιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.282
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.133
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.Mynd.
				20
			</span></i>; of philosophers, <i><span class="en">
