				<u>Philops.</u>
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοήμονα τέκτονα χαλκοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					907.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Sinope</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in one's right mind,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφρονέων,</span>
